# Network Topology

## Topology Type

The project uses a star topology.

All employee workstations and the central server connect to a Cisco 2960 switch.

The switch connects to a Cisco 2911 router.

## Device Connections

| Source | Destination | Connection |
|---|---|---|
| Office Router | Office Switch | Ethernet |
| Admin PC | Office Switch | Ethernet |
| Finance PC | Office Switch | Ethernet |
| IT Support PC | Office Switch | Ethernet |
| Office Server | Office Switch | Ethernet |

## Network Communication

The switch forwards traffic between devices within the same LAN using MAC addresses.

The router provides the default gateway for communication with external networks.

The central server provides DNS and HTTP services.

## Network Advantages

- Centralised network connectivity.
- Easy device management.

## Network Limitations

- If the switch fails, the LAN communication will be disturbed.
- The network uses a single broadcast domain.
